  "system": {
    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Vanguards are terrifying sentinels of heavy metal armor that use shields to devastate their foes, standing tall as mobile bastions of fortitude and might.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Iconic Vanguards</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Groot, Guardians of the Galaxy</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Havel, Dark Souls</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Juggernaut, X-Men</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Reinhardt, Overwatch</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Playing Vanguard</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The vanguard is a high-defense tank, trading off raw damage output for control. Actively defend through the Rush Action and Shoves.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Action: </strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Shove (Attack)</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Move:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Frontline</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Training:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Melee, Brawl</span></p>",
